d2full 0003: no builder thread: GameData::want_level queues the level (GameData::LevelBuilder::web_pending), poll_levels() builds one queued level per call inline as an already-ready future (so the neighbours of a new level hitch one by one, not all in a single frame), level() builds a queued level at once. The job is claimed in `jobs` before building (re-entrancy through want_nearby). Stage F4+: build in slices inside the DRLG.
